    "title": "'Fright Night' returns to Fort Getty for fifth year",
    "text": "The recreation department will sponsor its fifth annual Halloween festival from 4-8 p.m. Saturday, Oct. 25, at Fort Getty, 1050 Fort Getty Road.\nThe event, “Fright Night V at Fort Getty,” will feature live music from Purple Honey, carnival games, a bonfire and food trucks offering hot dogs, poke, grilled cheese, lobster, tacos, pizza, kettle corn, espresso and fried chicken.\nThe event also features a Halloween village at the RV park, in which the trailer site is decorated so children can go trick-or-treating.",
